    "tagline": "Drums, rave stabs and talking machines from the garden shed.",
    "blurb": "Packet No. 4 from the shed at the bottom of the garden: {count} presets of drum kits, rave stabs, pads, talking machines, taiko, tabla and mallets. Sow them in your music and watch them grow.",
    "intro": [
      "Thank you for buying Garden Rhythm Works, Packet No. 4. Like the three packets before it, it was grown in a shed in Maidstone, between the lawnmower and the tomato plants.",
      "Inside are drum kits, rave stabs, pads, perc, mallets and talking machines that say hello, meow and goose. Every preset is ready to sow."
    ],
    "maker_note": [
      "Colin wrote these on a 486 in the shed over the winter, with a paraffin heater and a lot of tea. Margaret says they are the best crop yet.",
      "If a preset does not come up, write to us and we will send a fresh packet.",
      "Potting Shed Software"
    ],
    "install": [
      "Insert the disc. In the Library tab it appears as GARDENRW95.",
